nge of work contexts. ", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of grammar, vocabulary; level of formality and purpose, and cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to this level.  Exchanges simple information on web applications, and applications for operating systems for personal computers.", "type": "secondary_1"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"content": "enpe7n6le03ob11re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Comparisons with Not As - As </strong>", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You can use <strong>comparatives</strong> when you want to compare two objects or to express some differences between them.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "There are different ways to make a comparison, one of them is by using <strong>not as \u2013 as</strong>, this structure must always be used in a negative sentence.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "They are not as complicated as you believe.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "if that's an event then it's not as hard as I expected.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "It's not usually as simple as the actions of users, sometimes the actions are produced by programs or browsers.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "When we want to make comparisons, we can use this structure: :<br /> <b> Negative sentence + as + adjective as + another sentence or subject", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Examples:<br /><i>Working with JavaScript is&nbsp;<b>not as easy as</b> some people think it is.<br /></i><i>Java is is not <b>as hard as </b>C#.<br />She <b>doesn't work as hard as </b>you.</i></div>", "type": "text"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "HTML5 Standard Events ", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "There are many events in HTML5 and JavaScript.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "This chart contains a few of the most common events in HTML5. For all the following attributes the value is Script. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":11,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\">Attribute</div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\">Description</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"offline\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"It activates when a document goes offline. \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"onclick\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"It activates when there is a mouse click. \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"ondblclick\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"It activates when there is a double mouse click.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"onerror\\t\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"It activates when an error occurs.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"onkeydown\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"It activates when a key is pressed.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"onkeypress\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"It activates when a key is pressed and released. \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"ononline\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"It activates when a documents comes online.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"onselect\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"It activates after selecting an element. \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"onsubmit\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"It activates after a form is submitted. \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"onwaiting\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"It activates when media is paused and it will be resumed.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "complicated", "type": "name"}, {"content": "hard or difficult to do or understand ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: They are not as complicated as you believe.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "enpe7n6le03ob11aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "manipulate", "type": "name"}, {"content": " to control a person or thing", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Just think of them as any interaction between the user and the browser when they manipulate a page.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "enpe7n6le03ob11aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "somehow ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "in some way ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adverb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Somehow, you are right.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "enpe7n6le03ob11aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "virtually", "type": "name"}, {"content": "practically, almost all of something ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adverb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: An event is virtually any response of the page to different actions.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "enpe7n6le03ob11aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "popup ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "little windows that pop up when you are interacting with any program ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The program recognizes that you are working offline and a popup notifies you about it. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "enpe7n6le03ob11aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "notify ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to give information about something to someone ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The program recognizes that you are working offline and a popup notifies you about it. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "enpe7n6le03ob11aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Search for more information about events in JavaScript. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Create a brochure with the most common events. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Describe the characteristics of each event in the brochure. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Share your brochure with the class.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I identify events in JavaScript. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I list some events in JavaScript. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I talk about the characteristics of events in JavaScript. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I share my work with the class.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}]}